#TS Media

A media-attributes visualisation built with the TypeScript binding.
Nine media forms are scored across five perceptual and social axes;
k-means clustering and a force-directed layout reveal structural
similarities.

`index.html` is the HTML template: it provides the page structure,
toolbar controls, CSS, and a `<!-- notlob:bundle -->` marker where the
bundled JavaScript will be injected.

`inject-script.ts` is the build hook.  After `notlob build` assembles
the TypeScript source, the hook bundles it to an IIFE via esbuild and
injects the result into `index.html`, writing `dist/index.html` — a
self-contained file ready to open in a browser or share as a single
page.

---

#Binding
    ~language typescript
    ~external index.html
    ~on-build inject-script.ts
